<title>UK: TMCC sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>TMCC sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    04.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.705   PAY DATE    04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA/  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ  NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
